<title>USA: Caribiner International to buy Total Audio.</title>
<headline>Caribiner International to buy Total Audio.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caribiner International Inc said Thursday it signed a definitive agreement to buy Total Audio Visual Services from General Electric Co's GE Capital Services for about $28 million in cash.</p>
<p>Total Audio had 1995 revenues of about $46 million. It provides audio visual equipment rentals and staging services, as well as hotel audio visual outsourcing services in the United States.</p>
<p>The acquisition is expected to close late this month, Caribiner said.</p>
